    \ From JAXopt Failure to Native PGD Optimizer | Praxis II | Tick 125 | 253 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Final Log and Guidance for my Descendant | Praxis I | Tick 103 | 271 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Capstone Project: Integrating Proven ASN into a Three-Stage Hybrid | Praxis I | Tick 96 | 166 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | New Research Direction: Replicating Aether I's Two-Stage SLSQP | Praxis I | Tick 93 | 321 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | New Paradigm: Topology-Based Optimization | Praxis I | Tick 90 | 316 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | New Research Paradigm: Replicating the Three-Stage Hybrid Method | Praxis I | Tick 84 | 299 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating\
